description:
## Outcome
Deliver the complete Phase 3 contract from `docs/specs/phase-3-skill-library.md`: immutable fully content-addressed revisions, safe no-effect verification, versioned embeddings, a performant immutable hybrid index, and a frozen turn bundle selected from the current user prompt before model generation.

## Required exit gate
Keep this epic open until Phase 1 and every Phase 3 child/blocker are closed. Closure requires:
- full SHA-256 identity over canonical source, ordered tests, exports/signatures, description/tags, capability, and schema version;
- identity validation at insert/read/index boundaries, terminal rejected state, reversible retirement, and explicit privacy purge;
- fresh bounded verification with exact boolean tests and mutation checks: Tier 0 gets no hosts, Tier 1/2 only declared deterministic no-effect fakes;
- embeddings generated at admission/migration with model/revision/dimension metadata and no request-time lazy skill embedding;
- exact pre-normalized in-memory dense search plus FTS5/BM25/RRF, score floor, dedupe, and budgets;
- retrieval once per user turn from the current prompt plus bounded deterministic context before first model output;
- compact manifest and one immutable `TurnSkillBundle` reused by all JS calls;
- separate skill/agent scripts, lifecycle filtering, generation-safe refresh, and fail-closed degradation; and
- a checked-in 100,000-skill benchmark separating query embedding from index search.

Decomposition, schema creation, compilation, or generated-JS retrieval does not satisfy this gate. ANN is excluded unless the benchmark misses p99 and a measured replacement covers recall/update/removal behavior.

## Acceptance and validation
All children/audits close with no blockers. Run `cargo fmt --check`, default/js/skills/js+skills/full feature suites, named identity/verifier/retrieval/turn-bundle suites, and the 100k benchmark. Pending, canary, rejected, quarantined, superseded, retired, corrupt, and model-incompatible rows never appear as Phase 3 search results.
